{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"80b7a751d7367a447b8ec2fe02cf444535f3051527a9e2c48b04a86d6fbe57a5","digest":{"component_or_area":"Cloud outbound comment deduplication","key_entities":["_JiraSanitizer.fit_comment","outbound_comments._diff_comments","acli_cli_ops.add_comment","AdfCodec.fit_outbound","_JIRA_COMMENT_MAX_CHARS","_ADF_DESCRIPTION_LIMIT","comment_limits.truncate_comment_body","fit_comment_as_sent","fit_preserving_marker"],"problem_keywords":["comment dedup","truncation mismatch","comparison key","send path divergence","body equality","comment fitting"],"propositions":["The differ's comment comparison key applies a plain 32,767-character cap while the Cloud send path fits against a serialized ADF limit of 32,000 bytes, causing divergence for over-length comments.","For a 43,200-character body, the differ key is 32,767 characters but the landed body is 31,753 characters due to ADF serialization overhead and marker budget reservation.","The two comparison and send paths cannot both call the same shared fitting helper, so body-equality dedup never matches for over-length comments where the primary ID-based skip may be unreliable due to lost map writes.","The divergence was introduced when commit 27b868ba55 moved the send path from a shared truncation helper to AdfCodec.fit_outbound while leaving the differ on the original helper."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787771217327458001,"uuid":"5e175ea7-014f-49eb-882b-fa026c6676ea"}